{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"36":"Signet-Rings (Kitab Al-Khatam)"},"section_detail":{"36":{"hadithnumber_first":4214,"hadithnumber_last":4239,"arabicnumber_first":4214,"arabicnumber_last":4239,"name_native":"সিগনেট-রিং (কিতাব আল-খাতাম)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4216,"arabicnumber":4216,"text":"। আনাস (রাঃ) সূত্রে বর্ণিত। নবী সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম-এর একটি রূপার আংটি ছিলো এবং এর পাথর ছিলো আবিসিনীয়।[1] সহীহ।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (5868) Sahih Muslim (2094)"}],"reference":{"book":36,"hadith":3}}]}